@startuml

[*] --> Order

state Order
Order : entry / placePlane
Order : exit / delivered

state Arrival
Arrival : entry / planeArrived
Arrival : exit / transitionPreparation --> Preparation

state Preparation
Preparation : entry / assignCondition
Preparation : exit / readyForOperationsOrMaintenance --> Operations | readyForPreparation --> Maintenance

state Operations
Operations : entry / hasScheduledFlights
Operations : exit / noMoreScheduledFlights --> Maintenance

state Maintenance
Maintenance : entry / checkAndService
Maintenance : exit / readyForPreparation --> Preparation

state OutOfService
OutOfService : entry / planeNotAvailable
Maintenance --> OutOfService

@enduml
